msgstr "WAV с опциональным сжатием IMA-ADPCM."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:546
msgid "Ogg Vorbis."
msgstr "Ogg Vorbis."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:547
msgid "MP3."
msgstr "MP3."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:549
msgid "*3D scenes:* See :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes`."
msgstr "*3D сцены:* Cмотреть :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:551
msgid "glTF 2.0 *(recommended)*."
msgstr "glTF 2.0 *(рекомендуется)*."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:552
msgid ""
"``.blend`` (by calling Blender's glTF export functionality transparently)."
msgstr "``.blend`` (при помощи вызова функционала экспорта glTF из Blender)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:553
msgid ""
"FBX (by calling `FBX2glTF <https://github.com/godotengine/FBX2glTF>`__ "
"transparently)."
msgstr ""
"FBX (при помощи вызова `FBX2glTF <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"FBX2glTF>`__ конвертера)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:554
msgid "Collada (.dae)."
msgstr "Collada (.daе)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:555
msgid ""
"Wavefront OBJ (static scenes only, can be loaded directly as a mesh or "
"imported as a 3D scene)."
msgstr ""
"Wavefront OBJ (только статические сцены, могут быть загружены "
"непосредственно как 3D-модель или импортированы как 3D-сцена)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:557
msgid ""
"Support for loading glTF 2.0 scenes at runtime, including from an exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Поддержка загрузки сцен glTF 2.0 во время выполнения, в том числе из "
"экспортированного проекта."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:558
msgid ""
"3D meshes use `Mikktspace <http://www.mikktspace.com/>`__ to generate "
"tangents on import, which ensures consistency with other 3D applications "
