#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:676
msgid "Support for advertisements using third-party modules."
msgstr "Поддержка рекламы с использованием сторонних модулей."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:681
msgid "XR support (AR and VR)"
msgstr "Поддержка XR (AR и VR)"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:683
msgid "Out of the box :ref:`support for OpenXR <doc_setting_up_xr>`."
msgstr "Из коробки :ref:`поддержка OpenXR <doc_setting_up_xr>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:685
msgid ""
"Including support for popular desktop headsets like the Valve Index, WMR "
"headsets, and Quest over Link."
msgstr ""
"Включает поддержку популярных настольных гарнитур, таких как Valve Index, "
