msgstr "Подборщик цвета с RGB и HSV режимами."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:719
msgid "Controls can be rotated and scaled."
msgstr "Элементы управления можно вращать и масштабировать."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:721
msgid "**Sizing:**"
msgstr "**Изменение размера:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:723
msgid "Anchors to keep GUI elements in a specific corner, edge or centered."
msgstr ""
"Якоря для удержания элементов графического интерфейса в определённом углу, "
"краю или по центру."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:724
msgid "Containers to place GUI elements automatically following certain rules."
msgstr ""
"Контейнеры для автоматического размещения элементов графического интерфейса "
"(GUI)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:726
msgid ":ref:`Stack <class_BoxContainer>` layouts."
msgstr ":ref:`Stack <class_BoxContainer>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:727
msgid ":ref:`Grid <class_GridContainer>` layouts."
msgstr ":ref:`Grid <class_GridContainer>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:728
msgid ""
":ref:`Flow <class_FlowContainer>` layouts (similar to autowrapping text)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Flow <class_FlowContainer>` (аналогичен автоматическому переносу "
"текста)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:729
msgid ""
":ref:`Margin <class_MarginContainer>`, :ref:`centered "
"<class_CenterContainer>` and :ref:`aspect ratio "
"<class_AspectRatioContainer>` layouts."
msgstr ""
"Макеты :ref:`Margin <class_MarginContainer>`, :ref:`centered "
"<class_CenterContainer>` и :ref:`aspect ratio <class_AspectRatioContainer>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:731
msgid ":ref:`Draggable splitter <class_SplitContainer>` layouts."
msgstr ":ref:`Переносимый разделитель <class_SplitContainer>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:733
msgid ""
"Scale to :ref:`multiple resolutions <doc_multiple_resolutions>` using the "
