msgid "And in GDScript:"
msgstr "И в GDScript:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:211
msgid ""
"In dynamically typed languages, arrays can also double as other datatypes, "
"such as lists:"
msgstr ""
"В динамически типизированных языках массивы могут быть заменены другими "
"типами, такими как списки:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:221
msgid "Or unordered sets:"
msgstr "Или неупорядоченные множества:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:230
msgid "Dictionaries"
msgstr "Словари (Dictionaries)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:232
msgid ""
"Dictionaries are a powerful tool in dynamically typed languages. In "
"GDScript, untyped dictionaries can be used for many cases where a statically "
"typed language would tend to use another data structure."
msgstr ""
"Dictionaries (Словари) — мощный инструмент в динамически типизированных "
"языках. В GDScript нетипизированные словари могут использоваться во многих "
"случаях, когда статически типизированный язык, как правило, использует "
"другую структуру данных."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.rst:236
msgid ""
"Dictionaries can map any value to any other value with complete disregard "
"for the datatype used as either key or value. Contrary to popular belief, "
"they are efficient because they can be implemented with hash tables. They "
"are, in fact, so efficient that some languages will go as far as "
"implementing arrays as dictionaries."
msgstr ""
