#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0001.rst:36
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0002.rst:44
msgid ""
"To fix a violation of this rule, add the ``partial`` keyword to the type "
"declaration."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы исправить нарушение этого правила, добавьте ключевое слово ``partial`` "
"к объявлению типа."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0001.rst:40
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0002.rst:48
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0003.rst:45
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0101.rst:43
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0102.rst:48
