"a :ref:`StandardMaterial3D <class_StandardMaterial3D>` to the mesh. The "
"focus will be on using the :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` to "
"dynamically create textures that can be applied to the mesh."
msgstr ""
"В этом руководстве предполагается, что вы знакомы с настройкой базовой "
"сцены, включая: :ref:`Camera3D <class_Camera3D>`, :ref:`light source "
"<class_OmniLight3D>`, :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>` "
