"Godot 4.0 <https://godotengine.org/article/fog-volumes-arrive-in-godot-4>`__ "
"article."
msgstr ""
"Подробное техническое объяснение можно найти в статье `Fog Volumes arrive in "
"Godot 4.0 <https://godotengine.org/article/fog-volumes-arrive-in-godot-4>`__."

