"github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/editor>`__ folder of the Godot "
"source repository."
msgstr ""
"Код редактора полностью автономен и находится в папке `editor/ <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/editor>`__ в исходном репозитории "
"Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/editor/introduction_to_editor_development.rst:39
