"`<method>` (in its `<description>` tag; return types and arguments don't "
"take separate documentation strings)"
msgstr ""
"`<method>` (в теге `<description>`; возвращаемые типы и аргументы не "
"занимают отдельные строки документации)"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/class_reference/index.rst:78
msgid "`<member>`"
msgstr "`<member>`"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/class_reference/index.rst:79
